{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Crystal Saga: Rise of the Crystals</i> is a story-driven RPG set in a world where the balance of elemental forces has been shattered. Players take on the role of Fredrick, a young soldier, as he embarks on an epic journey to restore harmony by reigniting the elemental crystals. Along the way, he assembles a diverse party, confronts dangerous foes, and uncovers hidden truths about the world and his destiny. The game blends exploration, strategic battles, and rich storytelling to create an unforgettable adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3392110?t=1761658023","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3392110?t=1761658023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392110/7f267b01c8dda882ac45be253ec4253d86e5f9b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761658023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392110/7f267b01c8dda882ac45be253ec4253d86e5f9b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761658023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3448630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Crystal Saga: Rise of the Crystals</i> is a story-driven RPG set in a world where the balance of elemental forces has been shattered. Players take on the role of Fredrick, a young soldier, as he embarks on an epic journey to restore harmony by reigniting the elemental crystals. Along the way, he assembles a diverse party, confronts dangerous foes, and uncovers hidden truths about the world and his destiny. The game blends exploration, strategic battles, and rich storytelling to create an unforgettable adventure.</p>","developers":["DayDreamStudios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id